  "remaining_behavior_gaps": [
    "std::move_if_noexcept constructor dispatch during buffer growth is observable for user-defined element types and is not represented by Rust Vec relocation.",
    "Rust cleans partially constructed tail values after panic; pinned OCCT leaves these objects untracked in raw storage.",
    "Appended and EmplaceAppend construct their Rust value before append can grow, whereas OCCT grows before construction; panic-time capacity state needs a separate direct regression.",
    "The native const ToArray1 returns a mutable buffer alias; Rust's shared Array1 view detaches on mutation."
  ]
